To add precision to our pricing, we're changing storage pricing from 3 decimals to 4. The change to our pricing will take effect on September 1, 2014. As a result of this change, you may see either a slight increase or decrease in charges to your Azure Block Blob Storage. <strong> </strong>

For more information, visit the <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/services/storage/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Storage</a> page. For a comprehensive look at pricing, visit the <a href="https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/pricing/details/storage/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Storage Pricing Details</a> page.

&nbsp;
